            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "2SA.7.1+2SA.7.2+2SA.7.3+2SA.7.4+2SA.7.5+2SA.7.6+2SA.7.7+2SA.7.8+2SA.7.9+2SA.7.10+2SA.7.11+2SA.7.12+2SA.7.13+2SA.7.14+2SA.7.15+2SA.7.16"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "2 Sam 7:1-16",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "1CH.17.1+1CH.17.2+1CH.17.3+1CH.17.4+1CH.17.5+1CH.17.6+1CH.17.7+1CH.17.8+1CH.17.9+1CH.17.10+1CH.17.11+1CH.17.12+1CH.17.13+1CH.17.14"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "1 Imila 17:1-14",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Elyo imfumu Davidi yaimine yalanda aiti,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.28.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.28.2"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 28:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.28.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.28.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 28:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Elyo Davidi apeela umwana wakwe Solomoni ifipepala ifyalelangilila ifyo engakuula Umuputule wa pa mwinshi we Tempele, amayanda, amatala, imiputule ya pamulu elyo ne miputule ya mukati no muputule wa cifulo ca kufutilwapo ifyabubifi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.28.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.28.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 28:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Amupeela ifipepala apali ukulangilila fyonse ifyo atontonkanya mu mano yakwe",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.28.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.28.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28:12",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "mu mano yakwe:",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Ba Baibele bamo batila “ku mupashi.”",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " pakukuula imansa sha ŋanda yakwa Yawe, ne miputule iyashingulwike, na pa matala ya mu ŋanda yakwa Lesa, elyo na pa matala ya fyamushilo ifyaletuulwa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.28.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.28.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 28:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Amukonkomesha na pa musango wa mabumba ya bashimapepo na bena Levi elyo na pa milimo yonse iyakubomba mu ŋanda yakwa Yawe, pamo pene ne fibombelo fyonse ifyakubomfya. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.28.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.28.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 28:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Amupeela golide icipimo ukulingana no wakubomba pakupangamo ifipe fyonse ifya golide, ifyakubomfya mu milimo iyalekana lekana. Kabili na silifa icipimo, ukulingana no wakupangilamo ifipe fyonse ifya silifa ifyakubomfya mu milimo iyalekana lekana. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.28.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.28.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 28:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Amupeela icipimo ca golide uwakupangilamo icakutekapo ifisaniko, ne fisaniko fyafiko ifya golide, cila cimo icakutekapo pamo ne cisaniko caciko, kabili ne cipimo ca silifa uwakupangilamo icakutekapo ifisaniko, ne fisaniko fyafiko ifya silifa, ukulingana ne milimo yakwete cila cakutekapo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.28.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.28.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 28:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Amupeela icipimo ca golide uwalinga ukupangilako itebulo lyakutekapo imikate. Kabili amupeele ne cipimo ca silifa uwakupangilako amatebulo yakutekapo ifipe fya silifa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.28.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.28.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 28:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Amupeela icipimo ca golide wine wine, uwakupangila amafoloko, imbale shakusambilamo ne ya nkombo. Amupeela icipimo ca golide wakupangila imbale imo imo, ne cipimo ca silifa wakupangila imbale imo imo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.28.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.28.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 28:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Amupeele ne cipimo ca golide uwasungululwa uwakupangila ubulambo bwakocelapo ububani. Kabili amupeela ne cipepala icalelangilila iceleta, emukutila bakerubi wa golide abafungulwile amapindo yabo no kufimba pa Mbokoshi ya Cipangano iyakwa Yawe.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.28.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.28.18"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 28:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.28.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.28.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 28:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Davidi asosa ati, “Fyonse ifi fyalembwa ukufuma ku kuboko kwakwa Yawe kuli ine, kabili alimpeela ukwiluka muli fyonse ifishinka fya mibombele.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.28.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.28.19"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 28:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.28.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.28.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 28:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kabili Davidi aeba umwana wakwe Solomoni ati, “Ube uwakosa kabili uwashipa no kubomba uyu mulimo. Wikwata umwenso nangu ukufupuka pantu Yawe Lesa, Lesa wandi, ali na iwe. Takafilwepo nangu cimo mu mweo obe nangu ukukuposa, mpakafye imilimo yakubomba iya mu ŋanda yakwa Yawe ikapwe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.28.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.28.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 28:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Amabumba ya bashimapepo na bena Levi yalifye ayaipekanya ukubomba imilimo yonse iya pa ŋanda yakwa Lesa. Kabili umuntu onse uwacenjela mu milimo iyalekana lekana ali nokukwafwa ukubomba. Elyo ne ntungulushi pamo na bantu bonse bali nokumfwila fyonse ifyo wakulabeba.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.28.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.28.21"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
